{
    "background_story": "Jenna was a free-spirited young woman with a passion for exploration. Growing up, she was always fascinated by the concept of nidifugous birds, which leave their nests soon after hatching. She felt a deep connection to their independent nature and desire for self-discovery. As soon as she turned 18, Jenna set out on a solo journey around the world, backpacking through distant lands and immersing herself in foreign cultures. She lived out of a small tent, relying on her wits and resourcefulness to navigate unfamiliar territories. Jenna's friends and family often worried about her safety, but she was determined to spread her wings and forge her own path. Her nidifugous spirit led her to discover hidden strengths and a sense of purpose, shaping her into a confident and self-assured individual.",
